  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 54653304f9c872b40a1778c9f86d4d70, type: 3}
  m_Name: Step22Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  TutorialStepIndex: 22
  DialogueList:
  - "Splendid! You\u2019ve mastered the fundamentals: shaping your hand, drawing
    and standing, juggling items, destroying persistent cards, and unmasking hidden
    cards."
  - 'But take this to heart: the lower your health falls, the stranger Wonderland
    becomes. Screens may shimmer, cards can hide, and opponents will seize nastier
    opportunities.'
  - "Yet danger breeds opportunity\u2014at the edge of defeat, you\u2019ll draw rarer,
    far mightier curios, powerful enough to turn the tide of any duel."
  - "I won't spoil all the marvels that lie ahead\u2014discover them yourself, and
    relish every surprise!"
  - Good luck.
